      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "This is exactly in line with how I've always thought.  In fact, I hate the em-dash (even before AI over-use), and I've always used the single-dash with spaces instead of it.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "elonmusk",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2103567689515954176/aR-Kjpp4_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-11-06 12:27:54",
