        "id": "2118560985678234094",
        "images": [],
        "media": [],
        "name": "Elon Musk",
        "text": "@yunta_tsai (The rules of English need to change to put spaces between the em dashes, as they presently too much resemble a hyphenated word, rather than a parenthetical phrase. Also, “—“ is an unpleasantly long a line. The en dash, “–“, is a better length.)",
        "url": "https://x.com/elonmusk/status/2118560985678234094",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
